{"server":"tw","storyId":"act12side_level_act12side_st01","groupId":"act12side","stageId":"act12side_st01","title":"不期而遇","storyCode":"DH-ST-1","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"216ecef9c21f943b4308d4012bb82594b7b3dcf764c521cecb269597a77105ad","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海選主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"這可真是太驚人了！沒想到在萬眾矚目的混戰海選中，居然發生了這樣的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海選主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"半路殺出來的兩人成為了本場海選的最後贏家！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海選主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"我想請問一下潘喬先生，這樣的情況是可以被接受的嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，這種情況確實比較少見。原則上，我們希望各位參賽者能夠遵守比賽規則。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海選主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼很遺憾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘喬","speakerId":"avg_npc_192_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偶爾發生這樣的事也不壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海選主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"噢噢，沒錯！咳咳，那麼很遺憾，這對其他參賽選手來說恐怕會是一個噩耗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，這主持人還挺會臨機應變的，他剛才是想說我們出局了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"或許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"看來我們誤入了比賽的賽場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"沒記錯的話，應該是叫大亂鬥海選賽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海選主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，各位，這場大賽的主旨就是為全市人民帶來歡樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海選主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"而這兩位雖然沒有辦理過參賽手續，卻憑藉著矯健的身手和絕妙的配合在混亂的賽場上存活到了最後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海選主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_200","isRemote":false,"text":"這難道不正是最絕妙的發展嗎！這難道不值得我們為她們送上我們最熱烈的歡呼聲嗎？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他說我們有絕妙的配合，有嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"最好沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......為什麼會變成這樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G01"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G03"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G06"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G07"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G08"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G09"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"爸，這封請帖是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"今年也來了嗎，真是個不死心的女人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"女人？不死心？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"我會告訴媽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"別想太多。商業城市聯盟裡的一個市長，大概十年前左右魏彥吾還有心情親自過去，往後就只是透過信使往來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"她倒是不死心，每年這個時候都會給我和魏彥吾寄信，請我們過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"商業聯盟......哥倫比亞的那座？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"不，玻利瓦爾的，你應當聽說過，她是那裡的市長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"多索雷斯，坎黛拉·桑切斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"那座城市，據說是個銷金窟......父親不去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"山高路遠，過去作甚？我的老胳膊老腿可經不起折騰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"況且就算我想去，魏彥吾去不了就沒有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，對方想要交好的必是身為龍門長官的魏先生，而魏先生公事纏身，確實無法隨意出行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"父親也不用妄自菲薄，您要是出遠門，花店裡的花可就沒人照顧了，叔叔伯伯們也少了個棋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你這丫頭，怎麼在你嘴裡我和魏彥吾差這麼多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"兩邊有貿易協定，魏彥吾若是想去，自然怎麼都能去，他就是膩了，那座城市，不是什麼好地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"而魏彥吾不打算去，我自是不會去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"我曉得了。那麼這封請帖我就拿去扔了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？文月夫人打來的電話？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":true,"text":"林先生，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"文月夫人，您怎麼想起給我打電話了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"是文月夫人的電話？那我不打擾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":true,"text":"雨霞也在嗎？別走，正好留下來，我要說的事與她有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞，留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":true,"text":"林先生，那封請帖你那邊也收到了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"一如既往。文月夫人有何指教？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":true,"text":"雖然我還是挺想去那裡度假的，不過彥吾這人你也知道，他這個人，懶得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"是，不過看來文月夫人另有想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":true,"text":"我想讓雨霞代表彥吾過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":true,"text":"彥吾那邊我會說服他，你不用擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事，確實是您做得了主的，這我並不擔心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，恕我直言，雨霞她還沒到接過重擔的時候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"爸，文月夫人說了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......夫人想讓你代表魏彥吾前往多索雷斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":true,"text":"林先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"罷了，乖女要出去玩，我這做父親的又豈有百般阻撓的理由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"就這麼安排吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":true,"text":"好。雨霞記得做好出遠門的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"我曉得。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"爸，我會給您帶土產的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你這丫頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，既然決定了，去做準備吧，這是一趟遠門，讓你媽幫你打點打點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"文月夫人這麼做，恐怕醉翁之意不在酒，度假......莫不是與小陳有關？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"罷了，多想無益，夫人向來愛護後輩，想來不會對雨霞不利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"比起這個......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"女大不中留啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月，林雨霞的事是你安排的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼問題，反正人家本來也只是請我們過去度假，又不是真的有事要和你談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你其實是想讓陳暉潔去，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我也沒打算瞞你就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"林雨霞代表我去，這樣陳暉潔過去玩樂也不會受到限制，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"小陳現在在羅德島，雖然我很信任他們，但我終究不知道她過得好不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我也明白小陳現在的立場是沒有資格代表你去赴約的，而雨霞辦事一向辦得很不錯，這樣不是正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠王的女兒不一定能成為鼠王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"但她既然有這個意思，就給她一個機會，抓得住，那就是她的本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，魏大長官要對我這個弱女子的僭越興師問罪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"這類決定我一向聽你的意見，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你見過坎黛拉，這個女人，陳暉潔和林雨霞，她們還太年輕，應付不來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊，整天說我瞎操心，到頭來你才是最愛操心的那個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你把你這性子改改，小陳也不會跟你那麼合不來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我們不是在說這個，文月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，靠自己讓多索雷斯在玻利瓦爾這樣的地方站住跟腳還聲名遠播，這樣的人當然不會簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡我又不是沒有和你一起去過，那裡啊，是你永遠不會去考慮的城市的樣貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"建立起這樣的城市的人，你魏彥吾站在龍門長官的角度和你個人的角度，會忌憚她也是理所當然的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你也這麼認為......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你們這些大人物，總是想著勾心鬥角，城府算計那檔子事，看別人也總是先去想這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說，我看到那個坎黛拉第一眼就知道，她會做許多事，好事壞事，但是唯有傷害小陳和雨霞這樣的孩子的事她是絕對不會去做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你擔心兩個孩子被她帶壞，我反而覺得，她們會在那裡過得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是實在放不下心，現在雨霞應該還沒有出發，給小陳的信我也還沒有寄出去，還來得及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"罷了，都依你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才在路上好像看到了羅德島的其他人，難道他們也來汐斯塔了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"等會去確認一下吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陳小姐，休假之中打擾，萬分抱歉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"白雪？你怎麼來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人有一封信給您，十萬火急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門出事了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"並非如此，讀信便知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......信呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......裡面還有一封請帖？還是先讀一下信吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"文月夫人還是那麼愛操心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這......我現在就在度假中呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人想來並不知曉此事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"也是。不過，多索雷斯啊......白雪，你知道距離這裡有多遠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"此城位於玻利瓦爾西北，現在出發的話，15日左右。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"請帖上也沒有寫日期，看起來什麼時候去都來得及......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"陳小姐打算接受嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......既然是文月夫人的好意，我也沒有拒絕的道理，反正也只是換個地方度假而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"白雪替夫人謝過小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"說了多少次了，我們現在同為幹員，就別叫我小姐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"白雪的回覆也不會變，不可，小姐始終是小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，隨你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟我一起去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"不，白雪另有要務在身，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，看來我得一個人出發了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，我出發時得知，博士以及一些其他幹員似乎在任務結束後也來到了這座城市，陳小姐若是想，可與他們見一面再走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？看來我剛才沒有看錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不過算了，反正回到羅德島也見得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，那......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"別急著走，留一晚上的時間還是有的吧？今晚和我一起吃頓飯，明天一起出發吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......恭敬不如從命。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"終於到了，這裡就是多索雷斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"和傳聞的一樣，踏入這裡之後，簡直讓人忘了自己身處玻利瓦爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，先......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"請問是陳暉潔小姐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"市長大人命令我們在關口等待您的到來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是來度假的，不用搞得那麼麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"不，市長大人吩咐您如果到了的話一定要通知她，請稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是二號關口，成功接到陳暉潔小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"......好的，好的，我明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"請跟我們來吧，市長大人說想要見您一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，行吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"請進，陳小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳暉潔小姐，看來是你先到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前就有耳聞龍門近衛局特別督察組的組長是位青年俊傑，今日一見果然是一表人才。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你......您就是這座城市的市長，桑切斯女士嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，我，坎黛拉·桑切斯，正是這多索雷斯的市長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......您的炎國語說得不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟我一直以來都想和魏先生交好，只可惜自從十年前開始他就沒有來過這裡，害得我費心思學的炎國語也沒有用武之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"桑切斯女士，我這次來只是度假的，不代表任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我的名字，坎黛拉就好，如果你願意，甚至可以叫我一聲姑媽，我可是和魏總督提過想和他結拜為兄妹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，桑......坎黛拉女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說話的口吻，還有你的眉眼，嘖嘖，和年輕時的魏總督可真像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我得說，當年的他，要比你還英氣三分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......我和魏總督沒有什麼關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心，陳世侄，文月夫人已經知會過我，你不代表任何人，也不用有什麼負擔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放開了玩，有我在，這座城市裡不會有東西能夠傷到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那就謝過您的美意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......您剛才說，是我先到了，意思是還有別人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對對對，你說巧不巧，她從龍門出發，你從汐斯塔出發，居然同一天到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，原來如此，看來文月夫人沒有告訴你，雖然你遲早會知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳世侄，你知道的，到了我和魏總督這種身份，就算我們不想，有些事也不得不按照一些約定俗成的東西來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，我倒是不介意魏總督隨便派一個代表過來，嗯......也不能太隨便，和你差不多就好，我會像現在招待你一樣招待這個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼關係呢，我邀請魏總督夫婦和鼠王是來玩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他知道不行，我也知道不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他可以不來，但不能隨便派一個人來，否則，這就是龍門總督對多索雷斯市長的不尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天你就能在龍門和多索雷斯的報紙上看到無數條類似的新聞，很多事也會毫無必要地麻煩起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，魏總督同時派了一個能代表他身份的人來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是星熊？不，詩懷雅嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"大人，到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧，來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"尊敬的多索雷斯市長，坎黛拉·桑切斯女士，我謹代表龍門總督魏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"林雨霞？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"陳暉潔？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳&林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會是你？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......我懂了，原來如此，難怪文月夫人會讓我來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......你就是那個代表魏彥吾來的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你們兩位還認識，那真是再好不過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"以前是同學而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友的朋友，不算很熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼在這裡重新認識一下不是很好的機會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，林世侄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和陳世侄一樣，你也可以直接叫我的名字，不用太拘謹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使你是代表魏總督來的也一樣，不用想太多，不要有任何負擔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要做的事情很簡單，那就是享受這座我引以為傲的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不過還有兩件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"請講。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，我聽說兩位世侄都身手了得而且思維敏捷，是做得了大事的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我在這裡給兩位世侄準備了一點額外的樂趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"額外的樂趣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過在說到這個任務前，兩位世侄，對於本城在夏季期間最盛大的活動有所瞭解嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"現在正在舉辦的夏日大獎賽嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眾所周知，多索雷斯最大的特徵，是城區環繞的“海”，以及海上的這艘船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘船是我費了很大的功夫才從伊比利亞的技術中復原的傑作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"船頭的雕像也是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，那個只是我個人的趣味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而多索雷斯的“海”，是從北面那片真正一望無際的海中抽取而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水放久了，會髒，會臭，所以每年我們都會換至少兩次水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而夏天，是下水玩樂的人最多的時候，所以，我們會在這個時節進行一次換水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本換水是一件枯燥乏味的事情，而且還要耽誤各位尊貴的客人至少一天的娛樂時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我也不願意讓客人們在骯髒的海水中遊玩，這對多索雷斯的名譽來說是一種侮辱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，極限鐵人大獎賽就應運而生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一場由我支持，在全城範圍內舉辦的真人秀比賽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具體的比賽內容如果你們感興趣，會有人告訴你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而比賽的獲勝者，將獲得親手按下換水閘的開關這份獨屬於這座城市的殊榮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將原本麻煩的事情轉變為盛大的節日了嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，沒錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實在的，兩位世侄能趕在夏日大獎賽前來到這裡我是很高興的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說陳世侄在啟程來這裡之前，正在汐斯塔度假？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳世侄覺得那座城市的音樂節如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不懂音樂，不過還挺熱鬧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那座城市的市長我也見過一面，他也算是為了自己的城市盡心盡力了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜啊，他這個人，本質上不適合當一座城市的主人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，區區音樂節，和我的夏日大獎賽也沒得比，哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看兩位世侄身手也相當了得，要是有興趣的話，完全可以試著去參加一下大獎賽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不過如果我沒記錯的話，海選的日子快要結束了，兩位世侄動作可要加快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是今年的比賽是兩位世侄組成的隊伍獲勝，那不僅魏總督臉上有光，我也會給兩位準備一份特別的禮物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"組隊先不論，參賽的話，我們會考慮的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"比起這個，您剛才說的樂趣是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，瞧我這記性。我給兩位世侄準備的樂趣也與這場比賽有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概就在上周，我的手下截到了一起爆炸物和通用源石回路的走私。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我允許很多事情發生，但這類事不行，兩位世侄也可以記一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我們大概不會需要用到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，當然，開個玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來呢，區區武器流通確實一點也沒有樂趣可言，但是，你們也知道，大獎賽就在眼前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"所以人手不足了嗎，而且在這個時候武器走私......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"想在大賽上做些什麼吧，可以試試從灰色地帶下手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯不錯，看來我給兩位世侄準備這個小樂趣果然是正確的，兩位世侄能感興趣真是再好不過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，兩位世侄如果玩樂之餘覺得有些不夠刺激，那麼，你們不妨試試調查著玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"調查著......玩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，尤其是你，陳世侄，我知道你這樣的人最喜歡享受查案子的過程了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......您不擔心自己的城市受到威脅嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"擔心？陳世侄，你不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有我在，沒有人能威脅這座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們完全可以將這個任務徹底拋在腦後去度假，或者參加比賽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若是這件事引發了什麼問題，也絕不會是兩位世侄的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我說的，這只是我特意為兩位世侄準備的，度假之餘的一點小小的樂趣而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。然後是另一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我也很想親自為兩位世侄講述由我親手打造的多索雷斯的種種輝煌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，既然魏總督本人沒有來，那我親自給兩位世侄作陪也是不合適的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以呢，我為兩位世侄準備了一個嚮導。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃內斯托，上來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坎黛拉女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這小子是我手下最機靈的一個外交官，叫埃內斯托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位小姐，午安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他也會炎國語，不過，這座城市裡的人大多是說維多利亞語和萊塔尼亞語，他可以給你們翻譯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不必，我都會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，那很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你們對這座城市有什麼不懂的地方，比如大獎賽的具體賽程，問他就可以了，沒問題吧，埃內斯托？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，你們要是被這個蠢材氣到了，也可以直接來找我，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我還有別的客人要見，就先走了，剩下就交給你們年輕人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝您慷慨的陪伴，坎黛拉女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很榮幸認識兩位美麗的小姐，我是這座城市的國際貿易管理部的副主任，埃內斯托·薩拉斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我埃內斯托就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎兩位來到這座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位想要瞭解這座城市或者去哪裡瀟灑的話，只管聯絡我就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坎黛拉女士給我下達的任務就是讓兩位感到賓至如歸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不必這麼客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，首先，兩位的手機已經接上了我們的城際網路，接下來兩位可以自由通訊和上網。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是我和坎黛拉女士的聯絡方式，可以直接找到我或者坎黛拉女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，這裡是市長為兩位準備的卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這座城市裡所有的消費都可以透過這張卡解決，金額不設上限，全部由市政府承擔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位隨意揮霍就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我們用不著這麼多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是這座城市的待客之道，兩位只管收下就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後......看起來兩位還有些話要說，我就不自討沒趣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我還要帶兩位去你們入住的旅館，所以我會在樓下等你們，兩位聊完了，下來找我就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，陳暉潔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，林雨霞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"上次見面是在什麼時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了，前年詩懷雅的生日宴會上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"那次我沒去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣，那是我記錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"大前年的同學會吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來氣色不錯，文月夫人知道應該也會高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"或許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"詩懷雅現在怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊沒告訴你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"她現在算是代理，做得還不錯，再過一陣子應該就能正式接過你的位子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"挺好。她只要收一收她的性子，是擔得起重任的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"很難，收得了她也不叫詩懷雅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"說的也是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"你問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼要幫他？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"兩位，不好意思，船接下來要靠岸一次，所以我來問問兩位要下船還是再在船上待一會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位如果還有要聊的，我也可以為兩位換個房間......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來我來得不是時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"你來得很是時候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"帶我們去旅館吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_118_yuki","aliases":["白雪"]},{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彥吾"]},{"speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","aliases":["文月"]}]}
